<title>USA: Britton &amp; Koontz Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Britton &amp; Koontz Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NATCHEZ, Miss. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited - Amounts in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					     For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net interest income			   $1,623	  $1,528</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses			$40	     $50</p>
<p> Net income					   582	     505</p>
<p> Net income per share (Primary)		1.32	    1.14</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding    441,718	 443,072</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the rise in Q1 1997 net was the result of increased loan demand and improved net interest margin.</p>
<p>Full name is Britton &amp; Koontz Capital Corp.</p>
</text>
